  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Typically used for running an establishment: *regentar un bar/una tienda/un hotel*.",
    "*Su hijo regenta el bar de carretera.* (\"Her/his son runs the roadside bar.\")",
    "*Regentamos esta tienda desde hace diez años.* (\"We've been running this shop for ten years.\")",
    "Related: *el/la regente* (manager/regent, noun), *administrar* (broader synonym, \"to manage/administer\"), *gestionar* (synonym, \"to manage\")."
